<section class="page-hero">
        <h1>What we help with before you travel</h1>
        <p>From first questions to records and appointment planning, here is what our support includes at each stage.</p>
    </section>

    <main class="service-shell">
        <div class="phase-block">
            <div class="phase-side">
                <div class="phase-label">Before payment</div>
                <h2>Free case review</h2>
                <p>For patients who want a first conversation before choosing a paid service.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-grid">
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Case intake</h3>
                    <p>We review your condition, timeline, preferred city, and what kind of help you may need.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Direction</h3>
                    <p>We explain whether a shortlist, cost guidance, or hands-on coordination is the best next step.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Expectation setting</h3>
                    <p>We explain what support we provide, what stays with the hospital, and when it makes sense to move forward.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phase-block">
            <div class="phase-side">
                <div class="phase-label">Hospital Acceptance Check — $199</div>
                <h2>Real hospital answers for your specific case</h2>
                <p>For patients who need to know: "Will a Chinese hospital accept my case, and on what terms?" We put your case in front of two hospitals and bring back both answers in writing.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-grid">
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Two hospitals contacted</h3>
                    <p>We prepare your case summary in Chinese and send it to the right department at two hospitals matched to your condition.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Answers in English</h3>
                    <p>You receive both hospitals' written answers: whether they will accept your case, the cost range, treatment duration, earliest available date, and what they need from you first.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>English support confirmed</h3>
                    <p>We check whether each hospital can support you in English during your stay, and give you a named contact in the international department.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phase-block">
            <div class="phase-side">
                <div class="phase-label">Full Journey Management — $649</div>
                <h2>From case file to discharge handover</h2>
                <p>For patients who have decided to travel. Most of the work happens before you land — so that when you arrive, nothing is left to chance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-grid">
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Before you travel</h3>
                    <p>Your case file prepared to the hospital's required format, visa invitation letter obtained, appointment booked with a specific specialist, and airport pickup arranged.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>While you are there</h3>
                    <p>A named coordinator who responds within 4 hours on business days, and acts as your channel to the hospital for anything that needs confirming.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>After discharge</h3>
                    <p>An English discharge summary, your records organised for your doctor at home, and follow-up check-ins.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phase-block">
            <div class="phase-side">
                <div class="phase-label">MDT Review — $499 · independent service</div>
                <h2>When one specialist's opinion isn't enough</h2>
                <p>A separate product, not part of the coordination tiers. Several specialists from the relevant departments review your case together and produce one coordinated recommendation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-grid">
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Case preparation</h3>
                    <p>We organise your records and distil them into a Chinese case summary with a structured question list.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>The panel</h3>
                    <p>Typically three to five consultants from the departments relevant to your condition, reviewing your case in one session.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>What you receive</h3>
                    <p>A written English MDT report, a video consultation with the panel through medical interpretation, and a walkthrough call. <a href="mdt-review.html">How it works →</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="phase-block">
            <div class="phase-side">
                <div class="phase-label">What is not included</div>
                <h2>Boundaries of the service</h2>
                <p>Clear boundaries help patients understand exactly what they are paying for.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-grid">
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Not hospital treatment</h3>
                    <p>Medical decisions, treatment plans, and hospital charges remain between you and the provider.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Not an insurance policy</h3>
                    <p>We do not replace insurance, guarantee outcomes, or promise approval for any procedure.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="phase-card">
                    <h3>Not unlimited concierge</h3>
                    <p>Additional or extended support beyond package scope should be discussed separately so expectations stay clean.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <section class="service-note">
        <div class="service-note-box">
            <h2 class="section-title">Clear, practical support</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">We keep the service clear so you know what is included, what to prepare, and what happens next.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="service-cta">
        <div class="service-cta-box">
            <div>
                <h2>Ready to talk through your case?</h2>
                <p>Start with a free case review if you are still deciding, or go to pricing if you already know you want support.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-actions">
                <a href="pricing.html" class="cta-button">See Pricing</a>
                <a href="contact-new.html" class="cta-button">Start Review</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
